        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 John Wiley & Sons Ltd/CNRS.",
        "AbstractText": "Marks et al. (Ecology Letters, 19, 2016, 743) showed tree species richness correlates with maximum tree height, and interpret this as evidence that the environmental stressors that limit tree height also act as ecological filters on species richness. Here, we strengthen these arguments by further addressing the roles of environmental covariates and beta diversity."
